  "content": "[G5]\n\n[Intro]\n[F#]\n[F5]  [Eb]\n[G5]\n[G5]\n[C]  [G5]\n[C]\n\n[Verse 1]\nIt is the springtime [F/A#]of\nmy loving,\nThe second season\nI am to know. [F#/C]\nYou are the sunlight in [F/A#]my\ngrowing,\nSo little warmth\nI've felt before. [F#/C]\nIt isn't hard to feel me [F/A#]glo-\nwing.\nI watched the fire that\ngrew so low.\n\n[Guitar Solo/Instrumental]\n[Csus2]\n[Gsus2]\n[G6]  [G5]\n[G7M]\n[G7]  [G7b13]  [D#]\n[Gsus2]\n[G]  [E/G]  [G]\n[Gsus2]  [Gsus4]  [G]  [G6]\n[Gsus2/D#]  [G]\n[Gsus2]  [Gsus4]  [G]  [G6]\n[Gsus2/D#]  [F#/C]\n[F/A#]\n[F#/C]\n[F/A#]\n[F#/C]\n[F/A#]\n[Csus2]\n[Gsus2]\n[G]  [G5]\n[G7M]\n[G7]  [G7b13]  [D#]\n[Gsus2]\n[G]  [G]\n[Gsus2]  [Gsus4]  [G]  [G6]\n[Gsus2/D#]  [G]\n[Gsus2]  [Gsus4]  [G]  [G6]\n[Gsus2/D#]  [F#/C]\n\n[Verse 2]\nIt is the summer of [F/A#]my\nsmiles,\nFlee from me\nKeepers of the Gloom. [F#/C]\nSpeak to me only [F/A#]with\nyour eyes.\nIt is to you I\ngive this tune. [F#/C]\nAin't so hard to [F/A#]re-\ncognize, oh.\nThese things are clear\nto all from time [F#/C]to\ntime. [F/A#]\nOoh.\n\n[Instrumental]\n[Csus2]\n[Gsus2]\n\n[Bridge]\n[G5]Ah, [D][Bm][F]\ntalk [F5]talk, talk, [G5]\n[C5]talk. [G5]\n[G5]I've felt the [D]coldness [Bm]of [F]my\nwinter, [F5][G5]\n[C5]I never thought [G5]\nit would ever go.\n[G5]I cursed the gloom [D]that [Bm]set [F]upon\nus, [F5]upon us, upon [G5]us,\n[C5]But I know [G5]\nthat I love you so.\n[G5]Ah... [D][Bm][F]\n[F5]  [G5]\n[C5]But I know [G5]\nthat I love you so [F#/C]oh.\n\n[Verse 3]\nThese are the seasons of [F/A#]emo-\ntion\nand like the winds\nthey rise and fall. [F#/C]\nThis is the wonder of [F/A#]devo-\ntion.\nI seek the torch\nwe all must hold. [F#/C]\nThis is the mystery of the [F/A#]quo-\ntient quotient. Oh,\nupon us all, upon us all a little rain-\nmust fall. [F#/C]\nIt's just a little rain... [F/A#]\n\n[Instrumental]\n[Csus2]\n[Gsus2]\n\n[Outro]\n[F]\n[Gm]  [G#]\n[G7#11]\n[G7sus4]  [G6]\n[Gsus2]  [Gsus2]",
